{"title":"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fcc8ee5333de18cf5330c44c0154a9b27b2f636f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"11\" /> are in arithmetic progression in that order.  They also satisfy\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e82200f6178b4604035329f89915bf71ea50e1d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_1^2 - x_2^2 + x_3^2 - \\cdots - x_{10}^2 = x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10}.\\]\" width=\"363\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Compute the common difference of this arithmetic progression.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the common difference of the progression. Then, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/a/72af1de45fd03e45117bd9cb4e6994bc48cc3ca2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (x_1 - x_2)(x_1 + x_2) + (x_3 - x_4)(x_3 + x_4) + \\cdots &amp;= x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10}\\\\ -d(x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10}) &amp;= x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{10}\\\\ d &amp;= \\boxed{-1} \\end{align*}\" width=\"523\" height=\"75\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1\">2008 Mock ARML 1</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=206547\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Mock_ARML_1_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Mock ARML 1 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215632\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 987/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 70/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 946/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.987      1 Template:Mock_ARML_box\n100.00%    6.987      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6943:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215632 and revision id 26186. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}